OK: 163 MiB in 32 packages
Removing intermediate container c4072a5b64c9
 ---> 1d3f688be243
Step 4/5 : COPY daemon /usr/local/bin/daemon
 ---> e95d27d30117
Step 5/5 : COPY config.yml /etc/daemon/config.yml
